    // mentions (varLog since the 'fn' keyword, minus this function's own parameters).
    // The snapshot goes into ONE overlay scope on top of the live chain, so a name the
    // body can read is always shadowed by its captured value while functions, classes
    // and constants - which carry no '$' sigil and are therefore never in the capture
    // set - keep resolving live, including ones declared after this point.
